tier: "trans-snapshot"

#### str_upper.rs

~~~~rust
// Auto-generated by a2r transpiler

fn my_upper(s: &str) -> String {
    s.to_uppercase()
}

fn main() {
    println!("{}", my_upper("hello"));
}
~~~~

